catter diagram in the coordinate plane as follows:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>First, we draw the independent variable (age) along the horizontal axis.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Then, we draw the dependent variable (weight) along the vertical axis.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Finally, we plot the points that correspond to the pairs from the data.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This gives us the following scatter plot.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-134014-a-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-134014-a-1\"></div></div></div>",
